SDL3 upstream commit 68655e977280e2071865e60d56283d5df43ada79 (2026-09-10, Ryan C. Gordon):
kmsdrm: Instead of demanding ARGB8888, try to find a supported surface format. Fixes libsdl-org/SDL#16136.
Applied to SDL 3.4.16 for Dirk's Linux bundles (2026-10-04): an R36S under ArkOS (RK3326, Mali) failed with
'Could not create EGL window surface'.

